# Source is text, always. `api/src/agent-messages.mjs` embeds a literal NUL as
# its pair-key separator (unambiguous for a `from\0to` join key), and git's
# content heuristic reads that one byte as "binary" — so every diff touching
# that file rendered as `Bin 5097 -> 5088 bytes`, unreviewable. This repo is
# public and every merge is a review, so a source file must never be able to
# hide its own diff.
*.mjs   diff
*.js    diff
*.ts    diff
*.tsx   diff
